# ORDER MATTERS: git applies the LAST matching pattern, so the catch-all goes
# first and the exceptions after it. Reversing these two blocks silently puts
# the generated pages back under text conversion.
* text=auto

# These are generated artifacts. The builder writes explicit LF, so a Windows
# build byte-matches a Linux build. Git must not rewrite line endings on them,
# on any platform, ever.
optima-literature/ela-reference-library.html -text
optima-literature/library.json               -text
optima-literature/data/*.json                -text
